  "task": {
    "objective": "Use three beams and two reusable clamps to carry the single heavy crate from the west bank to within one cell of (8,3). Successful delivery rewards every role +1.",
    "natural_termination": "Delivery or any unsupported worker/cargo loss terminates. A simultaneous failure takes reward priority (-1 each). Otherwise 128 steps truncate.",
    "interaction": "Only the carpenter can reposition beams and only the rigger can engage clamps. A path to one clamped bank carries workers; paths to both banks carry cargo. A support edit therefore changes another role's movement opportunities and can cause immediate load failure.",
